::GEO_U04_L05_Q20::
Question ID:<br>GEO_U04_L05_Q20<br><br>MLA Standard:<br>Readiness Support Only<br><br>Question:<br>A triangle has sides 8, 15, and 17. Why is it a right triangle? {
